ext("C036", " Report 79 (Ripples / Checker): the single support-silence report is the worst case — a lifetime buyer whose restore failed: 'Developer doesn't respond. Waste of time' (1★); §8.1.1 a visible support path from the entitlement-failure screen.")
ext("C027", " Report 79 (Ripples / Checker): 16 languages ship, 13 appear in the corpus; a Russian request (5★, 2026-04-24) shipped ~7 weeks later in a 'localized for 10 more countries' release; a UI of icons and grids draws no other language complaints; China produced zero text reviews despite a shipped Simplified Chinese localisation.")
